description:
By default, they are just so slow, that its easier to walk or jetpack around.
<br />
<br />Tried to keep balance between different types (for example, Bike is the fastest).
<br />Some additional gravity and boost tuning to make them manageable.
<br />
<br />Some adjustments may be needed depending on how you upgrade your vehicle (like wheel types affect slide/grip).
<br />
<br />You can modify each stat to your liking in the EXML.
<br />
